# Canonical test fixture: H.C. Verma chapter 5. Committed so a teammate can
# do `lecture-pipeline-v2 load-extraction out/extraction.json` and have a
# working graph + playable audio without re-running ingestion.
!artifacts/audio/chapter_physics_newtons_laws_of_motion/
!artifacts/diagrams/diagram_physics_newtons_laws_of_motion_*.png
!artifacts/diagrams/diagram_physics_newtons_laws_of_motion_*.svg
!out/extraction.json

